  "description": "Windows Registry / shell-integration helpers: auto-start entries, file-type associations, and Explorer context-menu verbs. Per-user (no-admin) by default.",
  "id": "FrostNova.Core.Registry",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-07-20T06:58:50.087Z",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "mnMC0UIY10E+udza8e/0uvyNSoVDm2vWEzKfzjnEDQxGY/qdPxvj6ze48vV41mSoU3ufDxY39dW0RAyEji7VYg==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 56286,
  "published": "2026-07-20T06:55:35.287Z",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0\n      - Add ContextMenuManager (register/unregister Explorer right-click verbs for files, folders, and folder background).\n      - FileAssociationManager: add Unregister / IsRegistered and call SHChangeNotify so the shell refreshes immediately.\n      - File associations and context menus are now per-user (HKCU\\Software\\Classes, no admin) by default; machine-wide registration is available via separate ...ForAllUsers methods (require elevation). NOTE: the previous FileAssociationManager.Register wrote machine-wide (HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT); it now writes per-user.\n      - Fix StartupManager.RegisterStartup dropping the executable path when arguments were supplied.",
